<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Image src="assets/banner.jpg" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 60, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 15, left: 60, width: 735, fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>消融：只有残差是不可替代的</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 23, left: 800, width: 200, fontSize: 15, color: '#BBD9F2', textAlign: 'right' }}>03 · <span style={{ color: '#FFF2CC', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>阶段 3</span> · 消融验证</Text>
    <Image src="assets/logo_bar.png" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 8, left: 1010, width: 210, height: 44, objectFit: 'contain' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 74, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 614, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 806, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Image src="assets/p_tab05.png" style={{ width: 800, height: 368 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8 }}>表 V　消融实验：上半段换融合方式，下半段拆 GCN 的三个设计</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 36 }}>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', padding: '12px 16px', background: '#FBF3F2', borderLeft: '4px solid #C0392B' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6675' }}>去残差（w/o Residual）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0392B', marginTop: 2 }}>NMSE ×5.4</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>
                        0.0043 → 0.0231，全表唯一数量级的变化。
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', padding: '12px 16px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D8DEE7', marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6675' }}>去动态图（w/o Dynamic）</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 2 }}>+14%</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>
                        固定邻接只剩空间近邻，跨区域相似场景连不上。
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', padding: '12px 16px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D8DEE7', marginTop: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6675' }}>其余融合方式</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 2 }}>+4.7% ~ +16.3%</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>
                        单编码器、加性、拼接、通道与交叉注意力，都在同一窄带内。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#E8F0FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #123C6E', padding: '13px 20px', marginTop: 22 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                结论很干脆：融合方式和建图方式带来的是几个百分点，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0392B' }}>唯独残差是数量级的差别</span>——因为图操作天生破坏像素对齐，只能学修正量。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
